    LogisticsSystem "1" *-- "*" BeltSegment
    note for BeltSegment "Shift register: Slots[0]=entry, Slots[n-1]=exit.\nStep order: deliver exit -> shift toward exit -> pull source.\nStepProgress += throughput/60 * dt; step fires on crossing 1.0."
